      "text": "On non-cognitivism, moral sentences are not candidates for truth or falsity.",
      "factual": true,
      "stance": "asserted"
    },
    {
      "id": "a4",
      "pos": 5,
      "text": "A. J. Ayer defended emotivism in Language, Truth and Logic.",
      "factual": true,
      "stance": "asserted"
    },
